# The devcontainer build context is the repo root (see build.context in
# devcontainer.json) so that the models feature resolves
# $PWD/.devcontainer/llm-lab-models.json at build time.
#
# That makes the whole repo visible to the daemon, so exclude everything the
# image build has no use for. models/ is the important one: it holds multi-GB
# GGUF weights that are bind-mounted at runtime, and sending them on every
# rebuild would be unusably slow.
.git
models
node_modules
target
build
dist
*.gguf
*.gguf.part
wip
